H:Polly Wolly Doodle" is an American minstrel song that became a popular 
H:children's song. It was sung by Dan Emmett's Virginia Minstrels, who 
H:premiered the song at New York's Bowery Amphitheater in February 1843, 
H:and is often credited to Emmett (1815-1904). Sourced from Wikipedia, July, 2025
